1. BASIS OF THE FIGURES

Miro hours below are calculated from scheduled weekdays =C3=97 8 hours, exclu=
ding weekends but not public holidays. They are schedule equivalents, not con=
firmed person-hour budgets.

Development effort figures are retrospective or forward-looking technical est=
imates. Actual incurred development hours are not recorded in the supplied Gi=
t/Miro data.

Miro estimates belong to functional tasks. Several technical objects support =
the same task, so repeated Miro figures must not be added together.

Source line counts include comments and blank lines. For DDIC definitions, ge=
nerated classes and Gateway projects, code-line counts are not a meaningful s=
ize measure.

Some artifacts were already present in the initial repository import. Their o=
riginal development dates and individual authorship cannot be established fro=
m Git alone.

Objects visible in the package are not necessarily completed business feature=
s. For example, an existing audit table does not mean that the complete Audit=
 Log function is delivered.

